  "notes": [
    "DM Tools 1.8.0",
    "\ud83c\udfa8 <b>New look</b> \u2014 a darker, more compact panel with cleaner typography. Compact layout is now the default.",
    "\u26a1 <b>Auto Ramp \u00b7 After Effects</b> \u2014 Comp + Warp + Ramps + Blur in one click. Automatically assigns Intro, Middle and Outro across selected clips, with a smoother Middle ramp.",
    "\u3030\ufe0f <b>Direction Shake</b> \u2014 adjust intensity and duration after applying, using a simpler control setup.",
    "\ud83d\udccd <b>Pin Drop & Key + Stroke</b> \u2014 guided setup for camera tracking and target creation. Choose your tracking point or ground plane, then follow the steps to apply.",
    "\u2699\ufe0f <b>Personal settings</b> \u2014 customize ramp strengths, shake intensity and duration, and compact layout. Your preferences are saved locally and only apply to you.",
    "\u2194\ufe0f <b>Fill & Align \u00b7 Premiere Pro</b> \u2014 fill the frame or center selected clips using compact icon buttons. Supports multiple clips.",
    "\ud83c\udfac <b>Color Grade</b> \u2014 no project template required. Missing adjustment layers and their LUTs are included automatically; existing items are kept.",
    "\ud83d\udcc1 <b>Organize Reels</b> \u2014 select a folder in the Project panel to organize portrait clips into a Reels subfolder. Existing Reels folders are reused.",
    "DM Tools 1.8.1",
    "\ud83d\udd12 <b>Security update</b> \u2014 stronger Google sign-in and personal credentials stored in macOS Keychain.",
    "\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <b>Verified updates</b> \u2014 signed updates, file integrity checks and recovery if installation fails.",
    "\ud83d\udce6 <b>Simple setup</b> \u2014 install DM Tools and sign in with your Desire Google account. No setup files required.",
    "\ud83e\uddf0 <b>Same tools</b> \u2014 your editing tools and personal settings stay in place."
  ],
